#: ../../quickstart.md:1
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "Ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ kíákíá"

#: ../../quickstart.md:3
msgid "Make your first request and read the response in about five minutes."
msgstr "Ṣe request rẹ àkọ́kọ́ kí o sì ka response rẹ̀ ní nǹkan bí ìṣẹ́jú márùn-ún."

#: ../../quickstart.md:5
msgid ""
"You need one of these on your machine: `curl`, Python 3.9 or later with "
"the `requests` package, or Node.js 18 or later. Nothing else to install."
msgstr ""
"O nílò ọ̀kan lára àwọn wọ̀nyí lórí ẹ̀rọ rẹ: `curl`, Python 3.9 tàbí tuntun "
"pẹ̀lú package `requests`, tàbí Node.js 18 tàbí tuntun. Kò sí ohun mìíràn "
"tí o nílò láti fi sori ẹrọ."

#: ../../quickstart.md:7
msgid "1. Set your environment"
msgstr "1. Ṣètò environment rẹ"

#: ../../quickstart.md:9
msgid ""
"Your API key and the server address live in environment variables, so "
"they never end up in your code."
msgstr ""
"API key rẹ àti àdírẹ́sì server wà nínú environment variables, kí wọn má bàa "
"wá sí inú code rẹ láé."

#: ../../quickstart.md:11
msgid "The demo key below is public. It is limited to 10 requests per minute."
msgstr ""
"Demo key tó wà nísàlẹ̀ jẹ́ ti gbogbo ènìyàn. Ó ní ààlà requests mẹ́wàá fún ìṣẹ́jú kan."

#: ../../quickstart.md:19
msgid ""
"If the demo server has been idle, the first request can take up to a "
"minute to respond. Later requests are fast."
msgstr ""
"Tí demo server bá ti wà láìṣiṣẹ́ fún ìgbà díẹ̀, request àkọ́kọ́ lè gba tó "
"ìṣẹ́jú kan kí ó tó dáhùn. Àwọn requests tó tẹ̀lé e máa ń yára."

#: ../../quickstart.md:22
msgid "2. Send your first request"
msgstr "2. Rán request rẹ àkọ́kọ́"

#: ../../quickstart.md:24
msgid "Ask the large model a question. Pick the tab for your language."
msgstr "Béèrè ìbéèrè lọ́wọ́ large model. Yan taabu fún èdè rẹ."

#: ../../quickstart.md
msgid "curl"
msgstr "curl"

#: ../../quickstart.md
msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

#: ../../quickstart.md
msgid "JavaScript"
msgstr "JavaScript"

#: ../../quickstart.md:49
msgid "3. Read the response"
msgstr "3. Ka response náà"

#: ../../quickstart.md:51
msgid ""
"A successful request returns status `200` and a JSON body like this. Your"
" `id` will differ."
msgstr ""
"Request tí ó ṣàṣeyọrí máa ń dá status `200` àti JSON body bí èyí padà. "
"`id` rẹ yóò yàtọ̀."

#: ../../quickstart.md:68
msgid ""
"The model is a stub, so `output` repeats your prompt inside a fixed "
"sentence. That keeps every example on these pages reproducible. The shape"
" of the response is what matters here."
msgstr ""
"Model náà jẹ́ stub, nítorí náà `output` máa ń tún prompt rẹ ṣe nínú gbolóhùn "
"tí a ti ṣètò. Èyí ń jẹ́ kí gbogbo àpẹẹrẹ tó wà lórí àwọn ojúewé wọ̀nyí "
"ṣeé tún ṣe. Àkópọ̀ response náà ni ohun tó ṣe pàtàkì níbí."

#: ../../quickstart.md:70
msgid "`id`"
msgstr "`id`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:71
msgid ""
"A unique ID for this generation. Log it if you need to refer to the "
"generation later."
msgstr ""
"ID aláìlẹ́gbẹ́ fún generation yìí. Ṣe log rẹ̀ tí o bá nílò láti tọ́ka sí "
"generation náà lẹ́yìn náà."

#: ../../quickstart.md:73
msgid "`model`"
msgstr "`model`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:74
msgid "The model that handled the request."
msgstr "Model tó bójú tó request náà."

#: ../../quickstart.md:76
msgid "`language`"
msgstr "`language`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:77
msgid "The language code you sent. If you leave it out, it defaults to `en`."
msgstr ""
"Language code tí o rán. Tí o bá fi sílẹ̀, iye àkọ́kọ́ rẹ̀ yóò jẹ́ `en`."

#: ../../quickstart.md:79
msgid "`output`"
msgstr "`output`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:80
msgid "The generated text."
msgstr "Ọ̀rọ̀ tí a ṣe jáde."

#: ../../quickstart.md:82
msgid "`finish_reason`"
msgstr "`finish_reason`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:83
msgid ""
"Why the response ended. `stop` means it finished naturally. `length` "
"means it hit your `max_tokens` limit and was cut off."
msgstr ""
"Ìdí tí response fi parí. `stop` túmọ̀ sí pé ó parí lọ́nà àdáyébá. `length` "
"túmọ̀ sí pé ó dé ààlà `max_tokens` rẹ̀ tí a sì gé e kúrò."

#: ../../quickstart.md:85
msgid "`usage`"
msgstr "`usage`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:86
msgid ""
"How many tokens the request used. `total_tokens` is `prompt_tokens` plus "
"`completion_tokens`. See [Tokens and languages](tokens.md) for how tokens"
" are counted."
msgstr ""
"Iye tokens tí request náà lò. `total_tokens` jẹ́ `prompt_tokens` àti "
"`completion_tokens` papọ̀. Wo [Tokens and languages](tokens.md) láti mọ "
"bí a ṣe ń ka tokens."

#: ../../quickstart.md:88
msgid "When the response is cut off"
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá gé response kúrò"

#: ../../quickstart.md:90
msgid ""
"Set `max_tokens` to 10 and send the same prompt. The output stops early "
"and `finish_reason` changes to `length`."
msgstr ""
"Ṣètò `max_tokens` sí 10 kí o sì rán prompt kan náà. Output yóò dáwọ́ dúró "
"ní kùtùkùtù, `finish_reason` yóò sì yí padà sí `length`."

#: ../../quickstart.md:107
msgid ""
"If you see `length` and you expected a full answer, raise `max_tokens`. "
"Each model has its own ceiling, listed under `max_output_tokens` in the "
"[model list](#choose-a-model-and-language)."
msgstr ""
"Tí o bá rí `length` tí o sì ń retí ìdáhùn pípé, gbé `max_tokens` sókè. "
"Model kọ̀ọ̀kan ní ààlà tirẹ̀, èyí tí a ṣe àkójọ lábẹ́ `max_output_tokens` "
"ní [model list](#choose-a-model-and-language)."

#: ../../quickstart.md:109
msgid "Response headers"
msgstr "Response headers"

#: ../../quickstart.md:111
msgid "Every response carries headers worth knowing about."
msgstr "Gbogbo response ní àwọn headers tí ó yẹ kí o mọ̀ nípa wọn."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Header"
msgstr "Header"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Ìtumọ̀"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-Request-ID`"
msgstr "`X-Request-ID`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Unique ID for this request. Quote it when you contact support."
msgstr ""
"ID aláìlẹ́gbẹ́ fún request yìí. Tọ́ka sí i nígbà tí o bá kàn sí support."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-Data-Region`"
msgstr "`X-Data-Region`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "The region that processed the request. Only on `/v1/generate`."
msgstr ""
"Region tó ṣe request náà. Ó wà lórí `/v1/generate` nìkan."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "How many requests you get per minute."
msgstr "Iye requests tí o lè ṣe fún ìṣẹ́jú kan."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "How many you have left in the current minute."
msgstr "Iye requests tó kù fún ọ nínú ìṣẹ́jú tó wà lọ́wọ́."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Seconds until the counter resets."
msgstr "Iṣẹ́jú-aaya mélòó kan ló kù kí counter tún bẹ̀rẹ̀."

#: ../../quickstart.md:121
msgid "Choose a model and language"
msgstr "Yan model àti èdè"

#: ../../quickstart.md:123
msgid "List the models to see which languages each one accepts."
msgstr "Ṣe àkójọ models láti rí àwọn èdè tí ọkọ̀ọ̀kan gba."

#: ../../quickstart.md:146
msgid ""
"The language codes are `en` English, `sw` Swahili, `ha` Hausa, `yo` "
"Yoruba, `lg` Luganda and `am` Amharic. If you send a language the model "
"does not support, you get an `unsupported_language` error that lists the "
"ones it does. See [Errors](errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Àwọn language codes ni `en` English, `sw` Swahili, `ha` Hausa, `yo` Yoruba, "
"`lg` Luganda àti `am` Amharic. Tí o bá rán èdè tí model kò ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún, "
"o máa gba error `unsupported_language` tí ó ṣe àkójọ àwọn èdè tí ó ń ṣe "
"àtìlẹ́yìn fún. Wo [Errors](errors.md)."

#: ../../quickstart.md:148
msgid "Choose a region"
msgstr "Yan region"

#: ../../quickstart.md:150
msgid ""
"The `region` parameter tells the service where to process your request. "
"Use `ke` for Kenya, `ug` for Uganda, `ma` for Morocco or `mu` for "
"Mauritius. If you leave it out, the default is `ke`. The `X-Data-Region` "
"response header confirms where the request ran."
msgstr ""
"Parameter `region` ń sọ fún service ibi tí ó yẹ kí ó ṣe request rẹ. "
"Lo `ke` fún Kenya, `ug` fún Uganda, `ma` fún Morocco tàbí `mu` fún "
"Mauritius. Tí o bá fi sílẹ̀, ààyè àkọ́kọ́ jẹ́ `ke`. Response header "
"`X-Data-Region` máa ń jẹ́rìí ibi tí request náà ti ṣiṣẹ́."

#: ../../quickstart.md:152
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "Àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ tó kàn"

#: ../../quickstart.md:154
msgid "[Authentication](authentication.md) explains keys in more detail."
msgstr "[Authentication](authentication.md) ṣàlàyé keys ní kíkún síi."

#: ../../quickstart.md:155
msgid "[Errors](errors.md) covers every error and which ones to retry."
msgstr "[Errors](errors.md) bo gbogbo errors àti àwọn tí o yẹ kí o gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kansi."

#: ../../quickstart.md:156
msgid "[Production checklist](production.md) is what to review before you ship."
msgstr ""
"[Production checklist](production.md) ni ohun tí o yẹ kí o ṣàyẹ̀wò kí o tó "
"tu ohun èlò náà jáde."